    <statement><p>Calculate <m>\mathbf{r}'(t)</m>, <m>\mathbf{T}(t)</m>, and <m>\mathbf{T}(3)</m> where
<me>\mathbf{r}(t)=\langle 3t^{2}, 2t^{3}\rangle.</me></p>
<p><m>\mathbf{r}'(t) = \langle</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/><m>,</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/><m>\rangle</m>.</p>
<p><m>\mathbf{T}(t) = \langle</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0003"/><m>,</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0004"/><m>\rangle</m>.</p>
<p><m>\mathbf{T}(3) = \langle</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0005"/><m>,</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0006"/><m>\rangle</m>.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>6t</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
