        <m>6t^{2}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{6t}{\sqrt{\left(6t\right)^{2}+\left(6t^{2}\right)^{2}}}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
