    <solution><m>\mathbf{r}(t)</m> to obtain:
<me>\mathbf{r}'(t)=\langle 6t,6t^{2} \rangle</me>
and so
<me>||\mathbf{r}'(t)||=\sqrt{\left(6t\right)^{2}+\left(6t^{2}\right)^{2}}.</me>
We now find the unit tangent vector:
<me>\mathbf{T}(t)
=\frac{\mathbf{r}'(t)}{||\mathbf{r}'(t)||}
=\frac{1}{\sqrt{\left(6t\right)^{2}+\left(6t^{2}\right)^{2}}}\langle 6t, 6t^{2} \rangle.</me>
For <m>t=3</m> we obtain the vector:
<me>\mathbf{T}(3)
=\frac{1}{\sqrt{3240}}\langle 18,54\rangle
=\left\langle \frac{18}{\sqrt{3240}}, \frac{54}{\sqrt{3240}} \right\rangle.</me>


</solution>
